            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="1. SYSTEM NAVIGATION&#xa;&#x2022; Use the central Dashboard to access all clinic &#xa;  modules.&#xa;&#x2022; Unauthorized access is restricted. Only users with &#xa;  &apos;Admin&apos; privileges may register new staff accounts.&#xa;&#xa;2. REGISTERING APPOINTMENTS&#xa;&#x2022; All fields are mandatory. Ensure the patient&apos;s &#xa;  contact details are verified before submission.&#xa;&#x2022; STRICT DATE FORMAT: All appointment dates must be &#xa;  entered exactly as YYYY-MM-DD (e.g., 2026-10-15).&#xa;&#x2022; STRICT TIME FORMAT: Time must be entered in 24-hour &#xa;  format (e.g., 14:30).&#xa;&#xa;3. VIEWING APPOINTMENTS&#xa;&#x2022; You must possess the system-generated Appointment ID &#xa;  to retrieve patient records.&#xa;&#x2022; If an ID is not found, verify with the patient that &#xa;  the registration was completed successfully.&#xa;&#xa;4. BILLING &amp; RECEIPTS&#xa;&#x2022; Billing strictly requires an existing Appointment ID.&#xa;&#x2022; Do not include currency symbols ($) when entering &#xa;  Consultation or Treatment fees; use numbers only.&#xa;&#x2022; The system will automatically calculate the total &#xa;  and generate a printable receipt upon submission.&#xa;&#xa;5. SECURITY PROTOCOLS&#xa;&#x2022; Select &quot;Remember Me&quot; at login to preserve your &#xa;  session token for the day.&#xa;&#x2022; Always click &quot;Logout&quot; or &quot;Exit System&quot; when leaving &#xa;  the reception desk to protect patient data privacy."/>
            <Property name="border" type="javax.swing.border.Border" editor="org.netbeans.modules.form.editors2.BorderEditor">
              <Border info="org.netbeans.modules.form.compat2.border.CompoundBorderInfo">
